    <h2>Why Use EJS?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> Rapid simulation creation with minimal code.</li>
      <li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Supports both Java and JavaScript implementations.</li>
      <li><strong>Cross-platform:</strong> JavaScript simulations run on almost any device.</li>
      <li><strong>Open Source:</strong> Part of the Open Source Physics community.</li>
    </ul>

